<title>USA: IVI Publishing expands board.</title>
<headline>IVI Publishing expands board.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>IVI Publishing Inc said Wednesday it elected Michael Brochu as a director, expanding the size of its board to seven members.</p>
<p>Brochu is president and chief operating officer of Sierra On-Line Inc, a developer and publisher of interactive entertainment, educational and home productivity software.</p>
<p>IVI is an electronic publisher of interactive, multimedia health and medical information.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
